-- Squashes every prior migration (001_baseline through 070_workspace_cohort)
-- into one file. Generated by replaying them in order against a scratch
-- Postgres 16 and pg_dump'ing schema + reference data (--inserts, so it runs
-- as one plain-SQL Exec in db/migrate.go; no COPY/psql metacommands). Roles
-- and grants are not in a dump, so the labproxy role (ex-067) is appended.
-- Databases that already recorded 001_baseline skip it; their stale
-- schema_migrations rows for the removed files are harmless.
-- Next migration is 002_*.
